{"a":["قُلْ هُوَ ٱللَّهُ أَحَدٌ","ٱللَّهُ ٱلصَّمَدُ","لَمْ يَلِدْ وَلَمْ يُولَدْ","وَلَمْ يَكُن لَّهُۥ كُفُوًا أَحَدٌۢ"],"e":["Say, \"He is Allah, [who is] One,","Allah, the Eternal Refuge.","He neither begets nor is born,","Nor is there to Him any equivalent.\""],"t":["Qul huwal laahu ahad","Allah hus-samad","Lam yalid wa lam yoolad","Wa lam yakul-lahu kufuwan ahad"]}